   complexity），(4) 给出 practitioner guideline：什么条件下 consistency signal 可能\n      有效。这仍然是 EMNLP-caliber contribution——venue 明确欢迎 well-analyzed negative\n      results。但需要大幅增加 analysis depth 来补偿缺失的 positive result，exp-009\n      (capability stratification) 和 exp-005 (temperature sensitivity) 从 supporting\n      升级为 core experiments。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0bfddaa4-e6b1-4892-a29f-4918f38f665f","total_cost_usd":0.17863125,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11791,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":3686,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11791,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3686,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11791,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11791},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":6752,"outputTokens":21,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.006857,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":3686,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":11791,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.17177425,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"8fcb8d9e-0698-4ea8-993c-43e9fef9f663"}
